@{
    Layout = "_PublicLayout";
    ViewData["Title"]         = "About WorkLog";
    ViewData["Description"]   = "WorkLog is a free daily work journal and AI-powered time tracker. Log work in seconds, export timesheets, and keep your data 100% private. No subscription needed.";
    ViewData["OgTitle"]       = "About WorkLog — Free Daily Work Log App";
    ViewData["OgDescription"] = "WorkLog is a free work journal for employees and freelancers. AI parses your entries, timesheets export in one click, and your data stays private.";
}

<div class="policy-head">
  <div class="ph-label">About WorkLog</div>
  <h1>Your personal work journal,<br>powered by AI.</h1>
  <p class="ph-meta">Built for developers and freelancers who want to know where their time actually goes.</p>
</div>

<div class="policy-body">

  <div class="about-feature-grid">
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">⚡</div>
      <div class="af-title">Log in seconds</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Type naturally — "3h on API gateway rate limiting" — and WorkLog parses it automatically. Or use voice input for hands-free logging.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">🤖</div>
      <div class="af-title">AI-powered insights</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Powered by built-in AI. Get daily summaries, improve descriptions, and parse natural language into structured entries — all without sending your data to third-party cloud services.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">📊</div>
      <div class="af-title">Timesheets &amp; exports</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Generate weekly or monthly timesheets in seconds. Export to CSV for payroll, invoicing, or sharing with your manager.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">↺</div>
      <div class="af-title">Recurring entries</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Set up templates for work you do every day — standups, code reviews, meetings — and WorkLog auto-logs them each morning when you open the app.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">🔥</div>
      <div class="af-title">Streak &amp; insights</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Stay consistent with a daily logging streak. See weekly hour trends, your most active project, and a gentle reminder if you forget to log after 4 PM.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="af-card">
      <div class="af-ico">🔒</div>
      <div class="af-title">Private by default</div>
      <div class="af-desc">Your data lives in your own database. The AI runs locally. Nothing is sent to third-party servers unless you choose to export.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Who is it for?</h2>
  <p>WorkLog is for individuals: employees who want a record of their contributions, freelancers who need to bill accurately, and anyone who's ever thought <em>"what did I actually do this week?"</em></p>
  <p>It's intentionally minimal — no project management overhead, no tickets, no boards. Just you and a daily record of what you did.</p>

  <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>

  <h3>Is WorkLog free?</h3>
  <p>Yes — completely free. No credit card, no subscription, no usage limits. WorkLog is a free work log app built for people who believe their data should stay private.</p>

  <h3>How is it different from other time trackers?</h3>
  <p>Most time trackers require you to start and stop timers. WorkLog works the other way — you write what you did at the end of the day (or type it mid-day), and AI structures it for you automatically. It takes 60 seconds, not 60 interruptions.</p>

  <h3>Is my data private?</h3>
  <p>Yes. Your journal lives in your own database. Nothing is sent to third-party analytics or advertising servers. The AI runs locally on your machine — your work entries are never shared.</p>

  <h3>Can I export my timesheets?</h3>
  <p>Yes. WorkLog exports CSV timesheets for any date range — compatible with payroll software, invoicing tools, and BambooHR. One click, instant download.</p>

  <h3>Does it work on mobile?</h3>
  <p>WorkLog works in any browser on any device. You can also install it on your phone's home screen for one-tap access — it behaves like a native app.</p>

  <h2>Support WorkLog</h2>
  <p>WorkLog is a personal project built with care. If it saves you time each week, consider <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/worklog" target="_blank" rel="noopener">buying me a coffee ☕</a> — it helps keep the project alive. For feedback or feature ideas, use the <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Contact">Contact</a> page.</p>

</div>
